{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>為 The North Face Pop-up 揭幕</p><p>朴寶劍驚喜登場「NUPTSE MEETUP」</p><p>由《請回答1988》到《苦盡柑來遇見你》，朴寶劍憑細膩演技與溫暖形象圈粉無數。今日（10月15日）佢以開幕嘉賓身份現身金鐘太古廣場，為 The North Face「NUPTSE MEETUP」期間限定展覽揭幕，與品牌經典 Nuptse 羽絨服一同成為焦點。</p><p>一眼認出蓬鬆輪廓 高山機能融入日常</p><p>Nuptse 於1992年面世，最初為高山探索而設計，透過分隔式羽絨結構減少填充物移位，提升保暖表現。蓬鬆輪廓辨識度十足，雙面可穿的設計配搭牛仔褲或機能長褲都能輕鬆穿出不同風格，由登山裝備走進日常穿搭，都能成為橫跨戶外與街頭文化的經典。</p><p>購物提案 ｜ 為你搜羅各地購物好去處，分享各種消費攻略，等你買得有眼光！即刻DM我哋分享你嘅購物提案！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179206570455184211_17167848136ad0c0a8a1e65.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179206570546794114_3359601476ad0c0a992efb.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179206570656340954_7422985906ad0c0aab09c7.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179206570847053186_20940021406ad0c0aca3b3a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179206570993242307_5653611916ad0c0ae0f004.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179206571113133951_1671362436ad0c0af546f9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p><p>Tags : IG精選 Nuptse TheNorthFaceHK</p><p>圖片來源：GOtrip編輯部 資料或影片來源： Gotrip IG</p><p>Oct 15 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T12:07:57.658011+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":519,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T12:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T15:18:37.822856+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T12:05:41.794317+00:00","content_hash":"a7e12902a7c40c1f31c2fed8e3c26f74110ff745b02fa35c1ea899f5b